{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a spy on an unfamiliar planet, anyone would have been greeted with hostility, but you were incredibly lucky! Trusting locals mistook you for a new neighbor and provided you with a house and a plot of land to live on. <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/9ce8856208efc2a8a8e833509f8f8a00.avif?t=1771268047\" width=1444 height=410 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You'll have to help out the locals: learn their stories, make &quot;friends&quot; or even something more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/67b8f84e963096dc26d77d00c7132427.poster.avif?t=1771268047\" width=976 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/67b8f84e963096dc26d77d00c7132427.webm?t=1771268047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Win favour of the villagers, impress them with your achievements.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Become a champion fisherman by showing patience and wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in farming and grow various crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Descend and explore the long-abandoned dungeons that hide secrets of the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Show off your culinary skills by cooking flavourful dishes. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889890/extras/0e9f62d6dc9eb70565c2cbd7c760bbdd.poster.avif?t=1771268047\" width=976 heigh